TYPES.md §3.7: an `export fn`'s parameters and result may not name a local type; E2111 at each type expression naming one.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local enum Grade { low, high }

local record Cost {
  n: Int
}

/// The cost of a grade.
export fn cost(g: Grade) -> Cost { return { n: 1 } }
-- findings.txt --
error[E2111]  a/a.canon:10:19
  cost is public but exposes the local type Grade: make Grade public or cost local

error[E2111]  a/a.canon:10:29
  cost is public but exposes the local type Cost: make Cost public or cost local

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
